To: the ward office
Subject: {type} on {road}

Date: {today}

There is a {type} on the footpath of {road} (segment {segment}, location {lat}, {lng}). It was photographed on {date}.{height}

This stops people who use wheelchairs, walkers or prams from using the footpath, and pushes them onto the road. Please inspect and repair it, in line with the accessibility duties under the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Act, 2016.

Photo: {photo}

